    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_receptionist_02",
      "hash64": "370504FDAA454505",
      "text": "El examen consiste en... ¡un [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]eslalon gigante[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_receptionist_03",
      "hash64": "370503FDAA454352",
      "text": "Debes llegar a la meta de la pista a lomos de tu\\nPokémontura dentro del tiempo límite.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_receptionist_04",
      "hash64": "3704FEFDAA453AD3",
      "text": "Te darán más detalles en el punto de salida.\\c\\nPara llegar, sube la cuesta que hay a mano\\nizquierda nada más salir del gimnasio.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
