    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_trainer_01",
      "hash64": "64B056279C27961C",
      "text": "¡Buenas! Te estaba esperando. Este es el punto\\nde salida del eslalon gigante.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_trainer_02",
      "hash64": "64B059279C279B35",
      "text": "No tiene mucha complicación: debes descender\\ncon tu Pokémontura por nuestra pista natural.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_trainer_03",
      "hash64": "64B058279C279982",
      "text": "Si alcanzas la meta dentro del límite de tiempo,\\nhabrás aprobado.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_trainer_04",
      "hash64": "64B053279C279103",
      "text": "¿Quieres empezar el examen de gimnasio?\\n¡El eslalon gigante te espera!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_trainer_05",
      "hash64": "64B052279C278F50",
      "text": "Disfruta entonces de las hermosas vistas nevadas.\\n¡Adelante!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_select_01",
      "hash64": "66DD846D70418449",
      "text": "¡Estoy list[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa para empezar!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_select_02",
      "hash64": "66DD816D70417F30",
      "text": "¿Me lo explicas otra vez?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_select_03",
      "hash64": "66DD826D704180E3",
      "text": "Aún no estoy preparad[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa...",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_trainer_06",
      "hash64": "64B055279C279469",
      "text": "¡Has alcanzado la meta a tiempo!\\c\\nTe has deslizado como un[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]a auténtic[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa profesional.\\nMe has recordado a Grusha en su época dorada.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_system_01",
      "hash64": "5BAE1046691347DE",
      "text": "¡Has aprobado de sobra el examen de gimnasio!\\nVe a recepción a informar del resultado, pues.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_trainer_07",
      "hash64": "64B054279C2792B6",
      "text": "¡Ay, qué pena! Me temo que no has aprobado.\\n¡Al menos no te has hecho daño! Algo es algo.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_trainer_08",
      "hash64": "64B05F279C27A567",
      "text": "Puedes presentarte al examen de gimnasio tantas\\nveces como quieras. ¡Nunca tires la toalla!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_ui_01",
      "hash64": "C4ACC717DB60A68F",
      "text": "Abandonar",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
